# Rendered output of the .md docs — generated from the markdown sources.
*.html
# ...BUT the Tab 2 map is a real source file, not rendered doc output. Without
# this exception the *.html rule above silently un-tracks it, so it never gets
# committed and every fresh clone 404s on Tab 2 (the /assets/maplibre_map.html
# iframe has nothing to serve). Keep it tracked.
!app/assets/*.html
